{'symbol': 'BG', 'date': '2022-11-29 07:00:00', 'title': 'BUNGE TO PARTICIPATE IN THE 2022 BMO GROWTH & ESG CONFERENCE', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS--( BUSINESS WIRE )--BUNGE (NYSE:BG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT GREG HECKMAN, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, AND ROBERT COVIELLO, CHIEF SUSTAINABILITY OFFICER AND GOVERNMENT AFFAIRS, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A VIRTUAL FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE 2022 BMO GROWTH & ESG CONFERENCE ON TUESDAY, DECEMBER 6, 2022 AT 2 P.M. EASTERN TIME.'}